# Normalise line endings to LF in the repo and in every checkout.
# Without this, Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf=true) get CRLF, which breaks
# `prettier --check` locally and — worse — ships a CRLF docker-entrypoint.sh
# into the Linux image when it is built from a Windows working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
